5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Hello everyone. It seems our current billing arrangement is a relic of a smaller household. To ensure we transition to a system that is both logical and fair, I suggest we start by examining the data.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited we're finally sorting this out! I want to make sure the new way is fair for everyone and doesn't make anyone feel stressed. Let's find some great ideas together!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I agree that a peaceful and fair arrangement is best for everyone. Let us look into the facts calmly to ensure we find a sustainable solution.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It is important that we base our decision on actual figures rather than assumptions. Let us be thorough in our research to avoid any misunderstandings or financial surprises later on.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Hi everyone! I'm glad we're talking about this. I want us all to stay happy and friendly, so I'm curious to see how we can make this work for everyone!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall examine the ""Plug-in monitor readings room by room"" and ""Sunlight and heating need by room."" It would be a pity to ignore the physical realities of our living spaces before deciding on the math.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I want to see how we've been doing things! I'll check the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template"" to see if we can make the process easier!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe it is important to understand the history of our payments. I will look into the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled"" to see how we have evolved.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I will look into ""The last twelve utility statements"" and the ""Electrician's quote for the rooms."" I want to understand the annual fluctuations in cost and any potential expenses for updating our setup.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I want to know how other people do it! I'll check the ""Monthly settle observed at another house"" and the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" to see if there are any clues!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. While some of you are focusing on the history of our payments, I shall focus on the actual consumption. It is far more elegant to solve a problem at its source.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, that sounds super smart! But I'm really curious about the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template."" If we can find a way to make the math a breeze, it'll be way more fun for everyone!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, a simple process would certainly bring more peace to our home. I hope the template you find helps us avoid any unnecessary friction during our monthly settling.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, a simplified process is helpful, but we must ensure the underlying calculations are accurate first. Efficiency is only valuable if the distribution of costs is truly fair and sustainable over the long term.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I agree with Victoria! I hope we can find a way that makes everyone feel okay. I'm really looking forward to seeing what the other house does to keep things friendly!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a harmonious home is built on a foundation of transparency. I shall leave you to your research, and I look forward to seeing if our findings align with the reality of our winter habits. Until then.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm ready to go! I'll dive into those logs and the template right now. I hope we find a way to make everything super simple and stress-free! See you all soon!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I shall begin my research now. I hope that by understanding our past, we can move forward with a clear mind and a spirit of kindness. I look forward to our next conversation.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will begin my research as well. I believe a clear understanding of our annual spending and potential costs is essential for a stable agreement. I look forward to sharing the results with you all.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll go look for those clues now! I hope the other house has some secrets for staying happy together. I'll see you all soon! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
