35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It appears the physical layout of our home is quite capricious. I've discovered that some rooms are naturally warmer, while others are essentially iceboxes, and the energy draw varies by a factor of four. Fascinating, isn't it?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, that's a huge difference, @Benjamin! But I found something a bit scary. Our payment logs show we've been really late settling up lately because people keep questioning the amounts. It sounds like a total headache!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is indeed concerning, Mio. I also noticed those delays in the logs. It seems there is a lingering uncertainty about the fairness of our current system that we must address to restore peace.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The financial volatility is quite stark. The statements show that our monthly costs fluctuate wildly, with February being more than three times as expensive as August. We cannot ignore these seasonal spikes when planning our budget.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found out that another house spends forty minutes just reading meters and doing math by hand! It seems like a lot of work. I also saw the late payments Mio mentioned... it makes me a little sad.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, forty minutes of manual arithmetic sounds like a delightful form of torture. We should certainly avoid that. However, the real tragedy is that we are paying for a ""shared"" experience while some of us are shivering in the dark.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, you're so dramatic! But @Minato, forty minutes is way too long! I checked that template, and it was a nightmare—keying in every single invoice one by one? We can't let the monthly settling become a huge chore!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, I agree. A tedious process only adds to the tension. If we combine that with the uncertainty I found regarding how newcomers were integrated, it is clear why some feel unsettled. We need a system that is both simple and transparent.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, transparency is key, but we must also consider the cost of implementation. I found that installing sub-meters would cost 34,000 yen per room, plus annual maintenance. That is a significant upfront investment for us to consider.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, that's a lot of money... I wonder if spending that much would make us feel better or just more stressed. I'm worried that the late payments mean people are actually upset with each other.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, spending a fortune to prove who is using the most energy seems a bit excessive. However, the fact remains that some of us are essentially subsidizing the warmth of others. It is a cold reality, quite literally.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, you're always thinking about the cold! But we have to think about the time too! If the system is too complicated, whoever does the math will be totally exhausted. We need something that doesn't swallow up our whole evening!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, while the physical differences are real, I worry more about the social cost. If we let rumors of ""carrying"" one another persist without a clear, agreed-upon rule, the coldness in our hearts will be worse than any drafty room.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, I agree that social harmony is vital. However, we must be realistic. With costs swinging from 9,000 to nearly 30,000 yen, a simple rule might not be enough to prevent resentment during the winter peaks. We need a sustainable financial plan.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, I think you're right. When people ask why the amount changed, it feels like they're arguing. I don't want us to be grumpy with each other just because of the bills. Can we find a way to be honest and kind?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Honesty and kindness are lovely ideals, Minato, but they rarely survive a February utility bill. If we don't acknowledge that some rooms are naturally more expensive to heat, we are merely polishing the surface of a very deep crack.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, you're so serious! But we can't just focus on the rooms. If we pick a system that's a total pain to manage, we'll all be grumpy anyway! Let's find a way that's fair AND super easy to do!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we can find that balance. If we establish a clear, objective method for division, the need for constant questioning will vanish, and we can return to a state of quiet harmony in our home.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. However, we must be careful not to choose a ""simple"" method that ignores the reality of our seasonal spikes. A system that feels fair in August may become an unbearable burden in February.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I hope we can find a way that doesn't make anyone feel bad. If we just look at the numbers, we might forget to be nice to each other. Let's pick something that makes us all smile!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
